                      <p className="text-blue-600 font-semibold">Operations Leader</p>
                      <p className="text-sm text-gray-600">U.S. Marine Corps Veteran</p>
                    </div>
                    <p className="text-gray-700 text-sm">
                      Experienced operations leader with a strong background in retail and warehouse management, backed by 
