                      />
                      <h4 className="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Prophet J. Davon Carter</h4>
                      <p className="text-blue-600 font-semibold">Strategic Advisor</p>
                      <p className="text-sm text-gray-600">Pastor, Arise Church - Decatur, Alabama</p>
                    </div>
                    <p className="text-gray-700 text-sm">
                      A voice of clarity, conviction, and divine order, Pastor Carter serves as Pastor of Arise Church in 
